Tanks! CE (tanks.rock): https://github.com/commandblockguy/tanks-ce commit
9eb79438a0ecd12cbde23be207257c650b703acb, by commandblockguy (John Cesarz), MIT.

engine/ holds the original physics, shell, mine and AI code with the CE
toolchain (graphx, keypadc, appvar I/O, eZ80 asm, 24 bit integers) replaced:
angles are 32 bit, util.h is new, ezSTL::vector is objlist.h, new/delete come
from a slot pool (pool.cpp), rendering was removed from the classes. The
original's tank art is Blender renders (not in the repository), and its
level pack (TANKSLPK appvar) is not either, so tanks_core.cpp draws simple
shapes and levels.cpp holds ten new missions. game.cpp is the original mission
loop as a step function. The original is a Wii Play fan clone; the upstream
readme says the author does not own the Wii Play copyrights. No separate
asset licenses.
